ion.\n\nDetails:\nwallpaper/playmat personal use commission\n\nCharacters:\nTakanashi Kiara from Hololive EN\nDiabellstar the black witch (alternative art)\nDiabellze the original sinkeeper\nJimmy the chicken,  the Kiara Mascot\n\nConcept: I'm a big fan of the White Forest deck and Takanashi Kiara from Hololive. So for this concept I would like to have artwork in which Kiara is a duelist and has a duel disk on her arm.\nKiara is striking an action pose with a card and the duel disk and she has Diabellstar and Diabellze at her side with Jimmy the mascot near her feet. I will attach reference materials.\n\nBackground could be very minimal but an interesting concept could be with a crowd on a stage. Like an idol performance, or a duel in front of her fans.\n\nReference material\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dP0rNiA6K4Q3Lzwlg1-cQM1iewd6b8N9?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dP0rNiA6K4Q3Lzwlg1-cQM1iewd6b8N9?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@puka_bgart/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3480191, "client_id": 3418897, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0338aac66c9ee6848181e96fb6abe938", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0338aac66c9ee6848181e96fb6abe938, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11508905c9da9decd072bf411aa6d156 2x, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&cr